OL,3,AMan charged after three Jewish women
OL,4,Aassaulted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbdisamad Siad, of Pilgrims Way,
OL,7,FIslington, has been charged with three
OL,8,Fcounts of assault by beating. He is due
OL,9,Fto appear at Highbury Corner
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court later.
